{"attack":"向对手发射坚硬的岩石进行攻击。连续攻击2~5次。","description":"攻击目标造成伤害，一回合内连续攻击2～5次。命中时，各有15%的几率攻击5或4次，35%的几率攻击3或2次，攻击次数的数学期望是3.1次，对应的威力的数学期望是77.5。\n携带机变骰子且命中时，各有1⁄2的几率攻击5或4次，攻击次数的数学期望是4.5次，对应的威力的数学期望是112.5。\n每一击击中要害的概率都相等。\n如果某一下触发了目标的气势披带、气势头带、结实特性或打破了替身，招式会继续攻击。\n忍耐、金属爆炸和双倍奉还只计算最后一次的伤害。\n如果使用者持有王者之证或锐利之牙，或具有恶臭特性，每一下攻击都有相同的概率造成对手畏缩。\n如果目标拥有咒术之躯、碎裂铠甲特性，每一下攻击都会触发效果。即使特性发动令攻击方陷入一些可能无法行动的状态（如麻痹、畏缩、着迷、定身法状态），也不会影响本次攻击，但陷入睡眠和濒死时攻击即刻停止。\n目标的变色特性在最后一下攻击完成后才发动。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Geodude","Level":30},{"Name":"Geodude form:alolan","Level":30},{"Name":"Graveler","Level":34},{"Name":"Graveler form:alolan","Level":34},{"Name":"Golem","Level":34},{"Name":"Golem form:alolan","Level":34},{"Name":"Rhyhorn","Level":30},{"Name":"Rhydon","Level":30},{"Name":"Omanyte","Level":45},{"Name":"Omastar","Level":49},{"Name":"Octillery","Level":0},{"Name":"Nosepass","Level":28},{"Name":"Anorith","Level":36},{"Name":"Armaldo","Level":36},{"Name":"Rhyperior","Level":30},{"Name":"Probopass","Level":28},{"Name":"Roggenrola","Level":32},{"Name":"Boldore","Level":36},{"Name":"Gigalith","Level":36},{"Name":"Dwebble","Level":32},{"Name":"Crustle","Level":32},{"Name":"Trumbeak","Level":0},{"Name":"Toucannon","Level":0},{"Name":"Necrozma","Level":48},{"Name":"Necrozma form:dusk","Level":48},{"Name":"Necrozma form:dawn","Level":48},{"Name":"Stakataka","Level":40},{"Name":"Rolycoly","Level":40},{"Name":"Carkol","Level":48},{"Name":"Coalossal","Level":54},{"Name":"Garganacl","Level":0},{"Name":"Klawf","Level":24}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":["Cinccino"],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Shieldon","Bastiodon","Cinccino"],"tmMoves9":["Diglett","Diglett form:alolan","Dugtrio","Dugtrio form:alolan","Growlithe form:hisuian","Arcanine form:hisuian","Geodude","Geodude form:alolan","Graveler","Graveler form:alolan","Golem","Golem form:alolan","Slowbro form:galarian","Shellder","Cloyster","Rhyhorn","Rhydon","Mew","Sudowoodo","Pineco","Forretress","Heracross","Slugma","Magcargo","Larvitar","Pupitar","Tyranit